{"pin":"AB02098","subcodes":[{"code":"AB02098","anchor":"","first_line":"O handmaidens of the peerless Lord! The gaze of divine favours resteth upon you, and boundless grace envelopeth you at the Sacred Threshold [3.5s]... ...O ye loving mothers, know ye that in God’s sight, the best of all ways to worship Him is to educate the children","first_line_orig":"ای کنیزان خداوند بی مانند نظر عنایت با شماست و کمال مرحمت شامل شما در آستان  ","language":"Per","word_count":"270","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_105BE #05 p.06","source":"AKHA_105BE #05 p.06","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_134BE #10 p.389","source":"AKHA_134BE #10 p.389","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.329.09x","source":"AVK3","locator":"329.09x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-333.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS5.088","source":"MAS5","locator":"088","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MAS5/mas5-88.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJTB.091x","source":"MJTB","locator":"091x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2023/05/mjtb.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT1.469","source":"MKT1","locator":"469","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA1/ma1-468.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#114 p.135x","source":"MMK1","locator":"114 p.135x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/898822347"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YARP2.670 p.451","source":"YARP2","locator":"670 p.451","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/YP/yp-457.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0639x","source":"COC"